      "writtenOn": "2025-02-25T21:12:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If `curr_prot \u003d\u003d PROT_READ | PROT_EXEC` then the write seal has already been applied on the file. However, `memfd_fcntl()` doesn\u0027t treat applying the seal multiple times as an error. Are you saying that we should check to ensure we don\u0027t apply the seal multiple times?",
      "parentUuid": "e25992e5_8128dd0b",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 114,
